  "result": "Perfect! All 169 tests pass. I've successfully implemented voucher support:\n\n**Added `applyVoucher(invoice, { code, amount })` to `src/invoices.js`:**\n- Applies a fixed amount voucher (in cents) to a draft invoice\n- Takes amount off AFTER VAT calculation\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n- Validates:\n  - Invoice is draft only (NOT_DRAFT)\n  - Only one voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS)\n  - Amount is positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID)\n- Never mutates original invoice\n\n**Updated `invoiceTotals()` function:**\n- Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- `voucher` is the voucher amount (0 if none)\n- `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher` (clamped at 0)\n\n**Updated `src/errors.js`:**\n- Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error code\n\n**Comprehensive tests covering:**\n- Applying single voucher to draft invoice\n- Voucher amount deducted from total\n- Preventing multiple vouchers (one per invoice)\n- Preventing vouchers on issued invoices\n- All validation paths (amount, count)\n- Correct total calculation with vouchers + discounts\n- Mutation safety\n\n**Example calculation:**\n```\nInvoice with LOGO-PACK (\u20ac1,200):\n- Subtotal: \u20ac1,200.00\n- VAT (21%): \u20ac252.00\n- Subtotal with VAT: \u20ac1,452.00\n- Apply voucher (\u20ac100): -\u20ac100.00\n- Final Total: \u20ac1,352.00\n```\n\n**Example with discount + voucher:**\n```\n10% discount on LOGO-PACK:\n- Subtotal: \u20ac1,200.00\n- Line discount (10%): -\u20ac120.00\n- Taxable amount: \u20ac1,080.00\n- VAT (21%): \u20ac226.80\n- Subtotal with VAT: \u20ac1,306.80\n- Apply voucher (\u20ac50): -\u20ac50.00\n- Final Total: \u20ac1,256.80\n```",
